	(text "1. LCD  HS20HS072RX 2.0in IPS 240x320 (ST7789), SPI 4-wire, 3.3 V logic"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9dd7a1c9-f3d6-5e96-9a75-061a0208a21b")
	)
	(text "FPC pinout (datasheet sec. 6): 1 GND, 2 CS, 3 RS (D/C), 4 SCL, 5 SDA (MOSI), 6 RST, 7 NC, 8 IOVCC, 9 VCI, 10 LED-A, 11 LED-K, 12 GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c6e13cc5-0377-509c-ac87-1448fe6f447f")
	)
	(text "Interface is hard-wired to 4-wire SPI inside the module (no IM straps on the FPC); write-only (no MISO), up to 62.5 MHz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cc647098-126a-5374-8c21-bdaed4acc45f")
	)
	(text "VCI 2.4-3.3 V / IOVCC 1.65-3.3 V: both on +3V3 = 3.33 V nom (~3.36 V max): accepted known deviation from the 3.3 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c0e4977a-1442-55a5-a15e-d69a12f480b3")
	)
	(text "  recommended max (abs max 4.6 V). Retrimming +3V3 to 3.30 V (power_rails) would remove it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "38ad0cff-c743-5223-ae27-49f175e2826f")
	)
	(text "MECHANICAL: U1101 is DNP (hand-fitted after assembly); its footprint is the panel outline. J1103 = Hirose FH34SRJ (dual contact,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "85a034ff-f9dd-578a-a954-275f57e6f99f")
	)
	(text "  1.0 mm high, 0.3 mm FPC) UNDER the panel, opening toward the tail edge, 14.5 mm inside it. The tail folds 180 deg under the panel"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 78.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2a874212-5ae5-596d-b1ae-a1591891a015")
	)
	(text "  (contacts face the PCB), so PANEL PIN n -> J1103 PIN 13-n. Foam tape >= 1.5 mm with a window over J1103 and the tail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "789e3ff9-07a3-55f8-b2da-93b0eb5be735")
	)
	(text "2. BACKLIGHT  4 white LEDs in parallel, Vf 3.0 V typ (2.8-3.2) @ 80 mA max -> from +5V, 39R, low-side PWM"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e33379b0-f487-5bd9-a95e-8c52b8dee1a2")
	)
	(text "Not from +3V3: 0.1-0.5 V headroom over Vf would make the current depend on LED Vf. 55 mA typ (+5V 5.13 V) -> ~0.28 W."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7904d2d6-2712-5dfa-b26b-733fdb7ba2c9")
	)
	(text "Worst case: bus-powered +5V = laptop VBUS up to 5.5 V: (5.5-2.8)/39 = 69 mA (72 mA at Vf 2.7 V hot) < 80 mA abs max."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6d653024-b4bc-5597-b7b7-e2cce305ec3b")
	)
	(text "  Min (4.75 V, Vf 3.2) = 40 mA. PWM does not reduce the peak current, so R1101 alone must keep it under 80 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "080d1696-33fd-5aab-baf4-b6bafc650908")
	)
	(text "PWM: LCD_BL_PWM (GPIO25, PWM4 B) at >= 20 kHz (inaudible), 0-100 %. Firmware dims after inactivity."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d9b69b91-d6eb-5239-a275-2c5839bd18fd")
	)
	(text "3. USER BUTTONS  side-push (actuator overhangs the front edge), active low"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "06c3f4f8-62e2-5cc5-ad12-d6d6ac9daab2")
	)
	(text "Button A: per-port forced-5V 'charge mode' toggle; button B: LCD page/select (firmware-defined, remappable)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fcc49187-60ab-5759-b85f-d75dd1de192b")
	)
	(text "Place on the front edge with the actuator 0.3-0.5 mm past the board outline. Footprint has 2 x 0.9 mm guide-boss holes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1f8a05a0-1fbc-5a31-b59e-8387a094823f")
	)
	(text "4. USER GPIO HEADER  2x8 2.54 mm, UNPOPULATED (in_bom no); series R + ESD + fuses populated"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0af6f250-8a9a-5016-9f32-eb61563641de")
	)
	(text "Pinout (silkscreen, top and back):  1 5V   2 3V3 | 3 G12  4 G13 | 5 G14  6 G15 | 7 GND  8 GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ce85079e-510b-5d5b-9a6e-1b8c50cbbe0d")
	)
	(text "                                    9 G16 10 G17 | 11 G18 12 G19 | 13 A4(G44) 14 A5(G45) | 15 GND 16 GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
